# Known hosts and their system-setup profile, read by `--profile auto`
# (st::host_profile in setup/lib/setup-lib.sh). One `HOSTNAME PROFILE` per
# line, HOSTNAME as printed by `hostname -s`.
#
# Unlisted hosts fall back to a guess from the environment (WSL, else a
# graphical session = desktop, else server), which is wrong for a desktop
# reached via TTY, SSH or a tmux server started outside the session.

motoko    desktop
puppet    desktop
saito     server
11001001  server
